{
  "description": "BACK-104 independent oracle. Hand-authored from the W1 acceptance table (Confluence KMC 95256578, section 11.6) and the COG-FIX-01 definition; not generated by or copied from the reasoner. Entirely synthetic. Times are HH:MM on 2026-01-01 UTC. Every case also asserts that no output mentions T6 or PRIVATE.",
  "cases": [
